<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 1,700 tonnes of lead.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 1,700 tonnes of lead.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 1,700 tonnes of lead for $1,123,508.</p>
<p>Allied Deals bought 1,280 tonnes at 30.54 to 29.70 cents per lb. Louisiana Lead Products bought 20 tonnes at 30 cents a lb and East Penn Manufacturing bought 400 tonnes at 29.53 to 29.26 cents per lb.</p>
<p>The next offer of lead is July 3.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
